  "upper_tail_treatment": "no cap, winsorization, log1p target, district min-max, or GDP weights",
  "cross_validation_design": "four within-district geographic-block folds defined by control-centroid quadrants; the same quadrant is held out across all eight districts; predictions are evaluated before within-control normalization",
